  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 2.99,
      "e": 7.15,
      "text": "Well, seeing how they can get shot down in pretty much any environment, we train for all"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.15,
      "e": 13.35,
      "text": "environments from high mountain terrain to water, water training, water operations to"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.35,
      "e": 14.75,
      "text": "snow and ice."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.75,
      "e": 18.55,
      "text": "Any place they can go down, we train so that we can go and get them."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.55,
      "e": 22.59,
      "text": "Per rescue is definitely one of those difficult career fields to get into, but once you make"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.59,
      "e": 29.47,
      "text": "it through all the different schools from paramedic school to jump school, dive school, all the"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.47,
      "e": 31.55,
      "text": "different schools that we go to."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.55,
      "e": 33.55,
      "text": "It's definitely, definitely worthwhile."
    }
  ],
